    for unit in xray-network-e159.timer xray-network-e159.service xray-network-e156.timer xray-network-e156.service xray-network-e154.timer xray-network-e154.service xray-network-e152.timer xray-network-e152.service xray-hw-tweaks.service xray-accel-e125.service xray-accel-e126.service;
